WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Observe: Remember where each toy started before they are moved into the left tray.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Goal 1: Move the toy that was originally on the left to the right tray.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Goal 2: Brush the spot where that toy originally stood, then return the brush.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:46.833
Goal 3: Return the toy to its original position.
